@startuml

title ROS Node Design Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "LiDAR Source\nGazebo / TurtleBot LiDAR" as Lidar

rectangle "Turtlebot3Drive\nROS Node\n\nturtlebot3_drive_node" as Drive

rectangle "TurtleBot Base\nController" as Base

rectangle "State Monitor\nDiagnostic Output" as Monitor


' ROS communication

Lidar --> Drive : /scan\nLaserScan

Drive --> Base : /cmd_vel\nTwistStamped or Twist

Drive --> Monitor : /wall_follower/state\nString


' Description of the wall follower node

note right of Drive
Receives LiDAR scans

Interprets scan data

Calculates wall distances
and wall heading

Runs the right-wall-following
state machine

Publishes velocity commands

Stops the robot when
LiDAR data becomes stale
end note

@enduml